SUMMARY:Elegant Estates: A Selling Exhibition
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261119T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261119T180000
LOCATION:Morristown\, NJ 07960
DESCRIPTION:Discover an eclectic selection of antiques\, fine art\, furnis
 hings\, collectibles\, and more at our Morristown gallery selling exhibit
 ion. The offering includes mid-century modern furniture\, modern and Tiff
 any-style lighting\, and art glass by celebrated makers including Steuben
 \, Tiffany\, Baccarat\, and Waterford.\nExplore dozens of original artwor
 ks by listed artists\, bronze sculptures\, Asian and English porcelain\, 
 sterling silver\, hundreds of American and foreign coins\, sports memorab
 ilia\, books\, and collectible Mettlach steins.\nWith an exceptional vari
 ety of objects spanning diverse interests and collecting categories\, thi
 s is an exhibition with something for everyone!
